es into fully or partly  developed animals  logia fruit wielders are referred to as  the natural type they are granted the  powers over natural elements this does  not only give them power over it but  also allows them to alter their body  into the very same element making them  immune to most physical attacks the last  known category belongs to the so-called  paramecia users which translated means  something like superhuman while these  fruits definitely grant the user's  superhuman abilities this category also  includes pretty much all those fruits  that don't really fit into the other two  now these three categories together  describe all types of devil fruits we  have encountered so far over the course  of the entire story kaido can turn into  a dragon aokiji can turn into ice and  katakuri loves donuts oh yeah and he  also can control mochi of course but  what would meta actually mean in this  context  meter powers are a concept that is often  misunderstood in many fandoms since it  can be a little bit difficult to wrap  your head around it when you go on  different forums or other discussion  platforms people often refer to the term  meta when it comes to powers like time  travel resurrection instant wind skills  or changing fate while all of these  concepts are without a doubt very  powerful and are usually out of the  ordinary none of these powers can  actually be described as meter because  what the word meter really means is  something that either refers to itself  or is self-referential in regard to a  story this would describe a power that  is able to affect the medium at work so  since the power system we are discussing  in regard to one piece are devil fruits  the term meat in this regard would refer  to powers affecting this very same power  system now while this might sound a  little bit confusing it is actually  pretty simple when you put it in another  way meter devil fruits have the power to  affect other devil fruits now what this  means is that 