te could for  example be having to touch your opponent  together with a certain time limit i  would see this fruit strength rather  outside of battle since copying  someone's power does not grant you their  experience with the ability so copying  luffy's rubber power would most likely  not allow you to compete with luffy on  his level since he had years to own his  skills with the fruit it would much  rather be useful if it were used in  stealth so you could use the copy power  for any other purpose open battle with  the media fruit against the person you  got the power from would in my mind only  be able for someone who has the wits to  understand and analyze any fruit quickly  and then immediately come up with  creative ideas on how to use them  nonetheless i think it would make for  some more than interesting battles if  this power really existed in the story  the next potential fruit that i really  want to discuss is the ability to  enhance other people's powers in essence  it would be the power to affect someone  else's devil fruit and make it stronger  or more effective again i think this  would require some limitations like a  time limit or a limit to the degree of  improvement still i think this would  make an amazing concept for a character  that has a supporting role in battle  with this you could for example increase  the magnitude of loki or paramecia users  and give more strength or additional  forms to zone types all in all i think  it would make for very interesting meter  power in the context of tactical and  strategic battles  nexon a smaller and less powerful but  nonetheless very useful power would be  the power to identify other devil fruit  users now while this would give you very  little to no advantage on a physical  level it would allow you to identify who  in the enemy's group uses a devil fruit  and maybe even which one this would in  my mind require fewer prerequisites  since the power is mostly based on  information still it would be a very  useful asset to any pirate or marine  crew especially in the grand line that  is full of devil fruit users with  unknown abilities  another potential meter power would be  the ability to transfer devil fruit  powers from one person to another  compared to the fruit identification  power this could actually be used in  battle very well transferring the power  of an opponent onto one of your own  cameras would not only weaken the  opponent but at the same time strengthen  your side you could also lend the power  of someone who has become unable to  fight to someone else in that way i  would also rather see it in a supporting  corner but it definitely would have  great potential in actual battle as well  the meter fruit i'm going to present you  now i would consider to be the most  powerful of all but at the same time i  don't think we'll actually see it in the  story the ultimate meter power in regard  to devil fruits would of course be the  creation of new devil fruits this would  grant the user such unbelievable power  that it would make it too plot  inconvenient and ridiculously  overpowered to be a normal power the  only way this could be integrated in  some form into the story would be to tax  its use with heavy restrictions or  limits funnily enough though there is a  theory out there some of you might have  heard of that proposes that the one  piece itself is in fact such a master  devil fruit and that goldie roger ate it  the theory goes on to state that the  fruit brought with it a curse that  transformed the soul of anyone that  roger killed into a new devil fruit now  while i'll personally do not like this  theory very much it would actually  integrate this power creation devil  fruit into the story  now lastly to round this up let's talk a  little bit about two relatively simple  but at the same time very relevant types  of media devil fruits  the first one i'm talking about here is  the power to steal powers this means  that a user of let's call it the steel  steel fruit would be able to take other  people's devil free powers from them now  this could play out in very different  ways you could steal someone's power  temporarily or indefinitely you could  steal it and acquire the power yourself  or you could simply rob the powers from  its user and then put it back into a new  fruit  now i think some of you have already  rang a bell at this point because the  power actually does exist in the story  already for some reasons we don't know  the blackbeard pirates are actually able  to steal devil fruits from their users  now while it's widely speculated that  this is not as much an individual power  than a method of extraction we still  cannot exclude the possibility that  there exists such a devil fruit out  there that grants this power maybe not  to blackbeard himself but to someone  else now the last power that i want to  introduce is the power to nullify devil  fruit powers this would not mean taking  their pals from them but simply robbing  them of the ability to use them and once  again this power has actually been shown  in the story before and once again  blackbeard was involved his yami yami  nomi seems to be capable of exactly this  meat of power it allows blackbeard to  drain any one of their abilities by  simply touching them all devil fruits  beat paramecia zone or logia seem to be  affected by this additionally unlike  seawater sea prism stone or armament  haki his nullification of devil fruit  powers truly seems to be absolute it  works as though devil fruit users had  never gained their powers in the first  place additionally the yami yami nomi is  also considered to be unique even within  the logia type so this fruit is actually  my strongest evidence for there actually  being meter powers in one piece it might  be a hint that there is actually a  fourth devil fruit category in the world  after all if you now ask yourself  whether such a fruit category wouldn't  be too overpowered compared to the  others consider this over the course of  the story for a long time we believed  that low-gear users had an incredibly  unfair advantage over the other  categories by simply being unable to be  touched while at the same time being  able to control the elements they wield  only with the introduction of haki did  logia users to a certain extent fall in  reputation behind the paramecia types  with introduction of the likes of  doflamingo big mom and katakuri wielding  incredible powers this was also  emphasized by oda by introducing karibu  and caesar into the story after the time  skip they are seen as kind of weakish  and comedy characters comparable to  buggy before the time skip and now  having finally arrived in wano people  start murmuring whether zone type users  might not actually be the strongest of  out of the three so if we now were to be  introduced to a fourth category of devil  fruit a media type of fruit it would  very likely be considered to be the  strongest but what this example actually  shows is that the power of the different  devil fruit types actually rather  depends on the power level and  intelligence of the user on top of that  every fruit type as well as every  individual devil fruit is subject to  certain weaknesses that come with its  power lightning is weak to rubber rubber  is weak to swords swords are weak to  zorro and zorro is weak to geography but  that's beside the point the point is  that at a certain level the type of the  fruit you use becomes less significant  while physical strength willpower  intelligence and personal experience  become exponentially more important  this would obviously also apply for me  to double fruits while their power would  without a doubt be incredibly strong  they would also be very situation  specific since they would only be able  to target other devil fruit users also  each power would have to include certain  conditions or prerequisites that would  come with them as can be seen in many  other devil fruits this may for example  be a time limit a limit to the amount of  usages a range limit or even a limit to  the user's health this kind of nerfing  would be necessary to ensure that media  devil fruits could fit in together with  all the other three types now if media  devil fruits actually existed in one  piece where would they be and who would  use them as we discussed before  blackbeard might very well be considered  as a kind of media fruit user already  due to his nullification powers  regarding other types of the media  category we have to consider that many  of the strongest characters haven't  actually been revealed yet we still have  close to no information about the powers  of two entire yonko crews as well as big  parts of kaido's crew additionally we  have the revolutionaries the marines and  former old pirates that we do not know  much about what are green balls powers  and what are the powers of the roger  pirates one entity that in my mind is  the most likely to be possession of such  powers would be the world government or  rather the gorosei and imsamar due to  their battle scars we can expect the  gorosei to actually be experienced in  battle and also im summa will most  likely have some sort of devil fruit  ability now since the world government  will most likely have hoarded the  strongest devil fruits to keep in use  for themselves media devil fruits would  be the ideal choice to deal with the  biggest threats to their reign

